# Next.js App Router

- Use App Router only (`app/`). No new Pages Router code.
- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Mutations: prefer Server Actions; use Route Handlers for webhooks and external callbacks.
- Print/file/n8n work runs on **Node.js runtime**, not Edge.
- Colocate route UI in `app/(public)/` and `app/(admin)/`; shared UI in `components/`.
- Data access only from server code via `lib/prisma` — never import Prisma in client components.

```tsx
// ✅ server
import { prisma } from "@/lib/prisma";

// ❌ client component importing prisma
```
